==Trivia==
*The damaged guardians' dialogue is a reference to various errors in software. 404 being a reference to error message: {{WP|HTTP 404}}.
*The name Akkhito may be a reference to {{WP|Akihito}}, the Emperor Emeritus of Japan. In Spanish the suffix ''-ito'' is a diminutive that can be added to many nouns and adjectives to create a smaller or more affectionate form (Small Akkha).
*The name Kephriti may be a reference to {{WP|Nefertiti}}, an ancient Egyptian queen, particularly known for an iconic and well-preserved {{WP|Nefertiti Bust|bust}} portraying her.
*When a player uses raw beef or raw chicken on Zebo, special dialogue will occur between the pet and the player referencing the "On a diet" invocation.
*Dropping Babi from the inventory then changing to a different metamorphosis variant will cause the chosen variant to inherit Babi's run speed. The same can be done in reverse to make Babi walk.

